{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-2a9c58483b71","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-2a9c58483b71","name":"完美水煮蛋","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E6%B0%B4%E7%85%AE%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"1c38efef70cee4d8e61f0e66471f37882f87ac4e","details":{"introduction":"这是一道通过科学家研发的循环水煮法制成的鸡蛋，蛋黄绵密细腻，蛋白均匀凝固，口感层次分明。它保留了更多营养素，多酚含量比传统煮法高 23%，蛋白质丰富。制作难度较高，需精准控温并反复转移，预计制作时长约 35 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 新鲜鸡蛋（推荐 AA 级）\n- 100°C 沸水锅（直径≥ 15cm）\n- 30°C 温水锅（直径≥ 15cm）\n- 定时器\n- 漏勺"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 鸡蛋 1 个（约 60g ）\n- 100°C 沸水 1500ml\n- 30°C 温水 1500ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 准备两锅水： A 锅维持 100°C 沸水， B 锅维持 30°C 温水\n2. 用漏勺将鸡蛋放入 A 锅，启动定时器\n3. 精准**每 2 分钟**将鸡蛋转移至另一锅水\n4. 重复转移操作共 16 次（总时长 32 分钟）\n5. 最后一次转移后，在 B 锅静置 30 秒\n6. 立即放入冰水（ 0 摄氏度）终止加热（维持 30 秒）\n7. 剥壳时从钝端气室处开始，沿纵轴剥离蛋膜"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 关键参数：\n  - 蛋黄中心温度：67±1°C\n  - 蛋白分层温度：\n    - 外层：100°C→87°C\n    - 中层：87°C→55°C\n    - 内层：55°C→30°C\n- 营养优势：多酚含量比传统煮法高 23%"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"选择全熟去壳鸡蛋，无油糖酱，不适用流心分支。USDA通用熟食每100g参考，非原菜谱实测。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":155,"protein_g":12.58,"carbohydrate_g":1.12,"fat_g":10.61},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients","version":"ff3f3065b9800055","fdc_ids":[173424]},"profile_id":"family-2a9c58483b71-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-2a9c58483b71","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_direct","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-2a9c58483b71","state":"cooked","cooking_method":"direct","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-2a9c58483b71-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg_boiled","grams":100}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"ff3f3065b9800055","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-2a9c58483b71-v1.c5d886e615ed4052.json","bytes":6973,"sha256":"c5d886e615ed40520a78e37e62671e13069008f26c938873459204eb40646d99"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-2a9c58483b71-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-2a9c58483b71","recipe_blob_sha":"1c38efef70cee4d8e61f0e66471f37882f87ac4e","version":"1","data_version":"ff3f3065b9800055","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_direct","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"选择全熟去壳鸡蛋，无油糖酱，不适用流心分支。USDA通用熟食每100g参考，非原菜谱实测。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-2a9c58483b71","state":"cooked","cooking_method":"direct","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-2a9c58483b71-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg_boiled","grams":100}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":155,"protein_g":12.58,"carbohydrate_g":1.12,"fat_g":10.61},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients","version":"ff3f3065b9800055","fdc_ids":[173424]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":false,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-2a9c58483b71-v1.c5d886e615ed4052.json","bytes":6973,"sha256":"c5d886e615ed40520a78e37e62671e13069008f26c938873459204eb40646d99"}}]}
